---
import { BUY_URL, PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { PORTAL_URL } from '../../components/commerce/links';
import '../../components/commerce/commerce.css';
---
<Base
  title={`Licence help · ${PRODUCT_NAME}`}
  description={`Enter your ${PRODUCT_NAME} licence key, move it to a new Mac, or get your key sent again.`}
  ogTheme="light"
>
  <div class="wrap cm-page">
    <header class="cm-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Licence help</p>
      <h1>Your licence key</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        After you <a href={BUY_URL}>buy {PRODUCT_NAME}</a>, Polar, our reseller, emails you a licence key.
      </p>
    </header>

    <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
      <a href="#enter">Enter your key</a>
      <a href="#devices">Manage your Macs</a>
      <a href="#resend">Lost your key?</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="cm-section" id="enter" aria-labelledby="enter-h">
      <h2 id="enter-h">Enter your key</h2>
      <p class="cm-intro">You can enter a key during the trial or after it ends. Nothing is lost either way.</p>
      <ol class="cm-steps">
        <li><strong>Copy the key</strong> from the email Polar sent after your purchase.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Open the licence window in {PRODUCT_NAME}.</strong> Choose <strong>{PRODUCT_NAME} → Enter Licence Key…</strong> in the menu bar,
          or press <kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>K</kbd> and type “licence”. After the trial, the <strong>Buy {PRODUCT_NAME}</strong> prompt has the same option.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Paste the key and press <kbd>↵</kbd>.</strong> {PRODUCT_NAME} activates it for this Mac. This needs an internet connection once.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="cm-note">
        <p>
          <strong>Working offline.</strong> After activation, {PRODUCT_NAME} checks the licence with Polar now and then when you're online,
          and keeps working offline for weeks between checks. The check sends your key and an activation ID, never your code.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cm-section" id="devices" aria-labelledby="devices-h">
      <h2 id="devices-h">Manage your Macs</h2>
      <p class="cm-intro">
        To move your key to a new Mac, remove the old one in the Polar customer portal.
        This works even if the old Mac is lost, sold or wiped.
      </p>
      <ol class="cm-steps">
        <li><strong>Open the <a href={PORTAL_URL}>customer portal</a></strong> and enter the email address you bought {PRODUCT_NAME} with.</li>
        <li><strong>Enter the one-time code</strong> Polar emails you. There's no password to remember.</li>
        <li><strong>Find your {PRODUCT_NAME} licence key.</strong> It lists each Mac where the key is active.</li>
        <li><strong>Deactivate the Mac you no longer use,</strong> then enter your key on the new one.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="portal-cta"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href={PORTAL_URL}>Open the customer portal</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="cm-section" id="resend" aria-labelledby="resend-h">
      <h2 id="resend-h">Lost your key?</h2>
      <p class="cm-intro">Your key is always in the customer portal, so you never depend on finding the original email.</p>
      <ol class="cm-steps">
        <li><strong>Open the <a href={PORTAL_URL}>customer portal</a></strong> and sign in with your purchase email and the one-time code.</li>
        <li><strong>Copy your {PRODUCT_NAME} licence key</strong> from the portal. Your receipts are there too.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="cm-note">
        <p>
          <strong>No code arriving?</strong> Check your spam folder for mail from Polar, and make sure you used the address you bought with.
          Still stuck? Polar's support can find your order from your purchase email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <nav class="cm-links" aria-label="Related">
      <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/download">Download</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .toc { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .toc a {
    padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); text-decoration: none; background: var(--bg-content);
  }
  .toc a:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--bg-hover); }
  .cm-section:first-of-type { margin-top: 56px; }
  .portal-cta { margin: 24px 0 0; }
  section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
</style>
